-- Reverts ONLY rows this pack touched (identified by the verification_note tag) and ONLY for standard DWA-M-820-2
-- (joined through worksheet_templates → standards.code). Every touched row was 'imported_unverified' before the
-- pack (uniform prior status captured from the 2026-09-05 export fields-DWA-M-820-2.json), so a single statement
-- restores the exact prior state. 111 ids = 100 quoted + 11 exempt. The 2 residue fields (client_type,
-- project_category) were never written and need no rollback.
